1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 12=

8
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:04,079
Why?

9
00:01:05,659 --> 00:01:08,180
I clearly tapped
into the world's water essence.

10
00:01:08,459 --> 00:01:11,780
Why did I hit
such an insurmountable barrier?

11
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,000
That's destiny.

12
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,640
Before destiny,

13
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:18,400
all living beings are mere ants.

14
00:01:21,819 --> 00:01:24,719
(Is Heaven truly going to destroy Qian?)

15
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,040
The cosmos is unfeeling,

16
00:01:26,799 --> 00:01:27,959
treating all like straw dogs.

17
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:29,640
The Dao is without mercy.

18
00:01:30,579 --> 00:01:32,939
But if Heaven won't give it,

19
00:01:33,739 --> 00:01:34,739
we'll take it by force.

20
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,079
Didn't you say destiny can't be changed?

21
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:38,500
Like I said,

22
00:01:38,659 --> 00:01:39,659
if Heaven won't give it,

23
00:01:40,579 --> 00:01:41,579
I'll take it.

24
00:01:44,260 --> 00:01:45,400
If you possess such power

25
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:47,579
and can bring down rain,

26
00:01:48,019 --> 00:01:49,900
you'll be the one
who gave me a second life.

27
00:01:50,299 --> 00:01:51,620
Whatever you need,

28
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,939
you have my full support.

29
00:01:56,260 --> 00:01:57,260
My lord.

30
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:58,920
Kneel!

31
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,219
I'm from the same village as him.

32
00:02:01,379 --> 00:02:03,079
He's been a thief since he was little.

33
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:06,299
My lord, Zhao Laizi's accomplice
has confessed.

34
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,500
They poisoned Master Zhang first

35
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:10,520
and then scammed him by curing him.

36
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:12,020
Speak!

37
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,020
I will confess.

38
00:02:13,340 --> 00:02:14,340
It was Zhao Laizi.

39
00:02:14,919 --> 00:02:16,300
He made me poison Master Zhang.

40
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:17,580
It's all his fault.

41
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:20,039
Zhao Laizi, you deserve a thousand cuts!

42
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:22,159
Arrest him!

43
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,039
Today, I pray for rain

44
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:31,439
and answer for it alone.

45
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:35,120
Lord Liang, I'll summon the rain today

46
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,479
to prove that I did save Master Zhang.

47
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,080
As for the rest,

48
00:02:40,139 --> 00:02:41,319
I trust you'll handle it.

49
00:02:49,819 --> 00:02:50,919
The Dao is unfeeling,

50
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,439
treating all like straw dogs.

51
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,500
Yet humanity feels,

52
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,599
passing down the torch

53
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:57,900
and striving endlessly.

54
00:02:58,860 --> 00:03:01,560
Today, I, Zhao Dong, shall defy Heaven

55
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:03,319
and claim the rain!

56
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:06,259
(Destiny, you want to track me down?)

57
00:03:06,599 --> 00:03:08,960
(Then I'll fill this realm
with my primordial spirit aura.)

58
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,340
(Let's see how you do it now.)

59
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:36,439
He spread his primordial spirit power

60
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,680
across the entire barrier

61
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,139
to evade my tracking.

62
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:41,539
To squander his primordial spirit power

63
00:03:42,699 --> 00:03:43,840
is truly foolish.

64
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,639
(Defying Heaven to change destiny)

65
00:03:47,939 --> 00:03:50,060
will surely warrant
heavenly thunder punishment.

66
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:53,300
Although I can't sense
your exact position,

67
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:55,099
I can make the Heavenly Dao

68
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:58,099
increase the thunder penalty
for you a hundredfold.

69
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:12,460
(It's the Zixiao Annihilating Thunder.)

70
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,300
(That woman has gained eternity,)

71
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:15,500
(yet she's still so spiteful.)

72
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,860
(I'll remember this.)

73
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:21,980
If the Dao is merciless,
then I shall defy it!

74
00:04:22,819 --> 00:04:25,680
In this life, I seek the Dao
for all living beings.

75
00:04:26,939 --> 00:04:27,939
Clouds, arise!

76
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,519
Now gather!

77
00:04:40,464 --> 00:04:44,580
♪If Heaven shows no mercy,
I shall defy it♪

78
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:48,278
♪Giving my immortal frame
for rain across the land♪

79
00:04:48,278 --> 00:04:52,224
♪Purple thunder above,
the people's pain within♪

80
00:04:52,224 --> 00:05:01,199
♪I'll break my path before my will
for the rain to fall tonight♪

81
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:03,500
Wretched woman, is that all you've got?

82
00:05:05,472 --> 00:05:09,568
♪Wave after wave,
blood and ash seeping into the soil♪

83
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,740
Wind, come!

84
00:05:13,308 --> 00:05:16,208
♪Someone weeps, someone prays,
but he hears only himself♪

85
00:05:17,939 --> 00:05:19,120
Thunder and lightning!

86
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,300
Let the rain fall!

87
00:05:24,272 --> 00:05:27,839
♪Now Heaven shows mercy,
and rain tears through the clouds♪

88
00:05:27,839 --> 00:05:29,540
Wonderful, it's raining!

89
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:32,519
It's raining!

90
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:36,082
♪The divine thunder fades,
and myriad homes now glow♪

91
00:05:36,912 --> 00:05:38,848
(Affection: 65)

92
00:05:46,959 --> 00:05:48,279
(This is the Dao of Sentience.)

93
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:50,500
(The merit gathered
from all beings' faith)

94
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:51,899
(is supreme and vast.)

95
00:05:54,740 --> 00:05:57,839
(Destiny, you fueled
the heavenly thunder to kill me.)

96
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:00,420
(Then I'll use
the merit of faith I gained)

97
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,319
(to pull you into my Dao of Karma)

98
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:03,939
(and cast you down from eternity.)

99
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:09,839
♪Eyes closed, rain washing
his thunder scar deeper♪

100
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:10,839
Curse you!

101
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:13,439
How dare you drag me down from eternity!

102
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:14,500
You're dead!

103
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:17,776
(Affection: -10,000)

104
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,139
It's his Dao of Karma.

105
00:06:33,939 --> 00:06:35,939
Dong, are you all right?

106
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:36,980
I'm fine.

107
00:06:37,300 --> 00:06:39,500
No, let me check.

108
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:44,319
Zhao Dong, I want to have
a serious talk with you.

109
00:06:46,100 --> 00:06:48,720
I don't have time for your issues.

110
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,040
You...

111
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,319
Dong, what's wrong with her?

112
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,600
The poison flared up.

113
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,600
What do we do then?

114
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,300
Should we find a room?

115
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,600
Too many prying eyes here.

116
00:07:06,420 --> 00:07:07,420
Let's head to the inn.

117
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:15,180
My lady, just as we suspected.

118
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:17,800
Xi Yun is indeed Empress Chu Yunxi.

119
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:20,300
My lady, I'll go report
to the lord immediately.

120
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,480
Fool.

121
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:27,740
May I ask what you suggest, my lady?

122
00:07:27,939 --> 00:07:29,199
Wouldn't we get more credit

123
00:07:29,660 --> 00:07:30,939
if we seize her directly?

124
00:07:31,459 --> 00:07:32,639
You can't even see that?

125
00:07:32,939 --> 00:07:33,939
You're a fool.

126
00:07:34,939 --> 00:07:37,480
You are indeed brilliant, my lady.

127
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:40,040
Go search the entire city.

128
00:07:40,300 --> 00:07:41,300
Find her, no matter what.

129
00:07:41,379 --> 00:07:42,379
- Yes!
- Yes!

130
00:07:56,259 --> 00:07:59,100
Why does Your Majesty
look so flustered and flushed?

131
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:02,000
That's hardly dignified for an empress.

132
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,060
Su Wan'er,

133
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:06,959
get out.

134
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:11,040
How many in this world ever see
Your Majesty lose your composure?

135
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:13,800
Probably just me and my husband.

136
00:08:14,259 --> 00:08:16,019
I wouldn't leave
even if it cost me my head.

137
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:22,000
Zhao Dong, I feel awful.

138
00:08:24,579 --> 00:08:26,279
Can you cure me?

139
00:08:28,579 --> 00:08:31,259
Whoever poisoned you
was truly despicable.

140
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:34,039
He used a Love Gu poison.

141
00:08:35,620 --> 00:08:37,220
When it flares up,

142
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:41,039
if you don't consummate, it'll feel
like a million ants eating you alive.

143
00:08:42,379 --> 00:08:44,000
I thought it was something serious.

144
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,539
That's easy enough, Dong.

145
00:08:45,539 --> 00:08:46,879
We can just find her a man.

146
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,399
Chunjiang Pavilion has plenty of men.

147
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:50,580
Leave it to me.

148
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,340
Su Wan'er.

149
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:55,419
You're seeking death.

150
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:57,600
Well, I'm so scared.

151
00:08:59,279 --> 00:09:00,539
It's not that simple.

152
00:09:01,299 --> 00:09:04,120
The Gu poison contains
the poisoner's blood essence.

153
00:09:04,860 --> 00:09:05,860
That means

154
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:08,700
it can only be relieved
by consummating with the poisoner.

155
00:09:09,419 --> 00:09:10,580
It flares up once a month,

156
00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:13,600
meaning she must engage
in intimacy every month.

157
00:09:14,659 --> 00:09:16,000
But the tricky part now is

158
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:19,259
that the poisoner is dead.

159
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:29,720
I would rather die
than be defiled by such a scoundrel.

160
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:32,919
Zhao Dong,

161
00:09:34,399 --> 00:09:36,059
even if you can't save me,

162
00:09:37,220 --> 00:09:38,639
thank you anyway.

163
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,200
Dong,

164
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:44,720
can't you save Yunxi?

165
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:48,100
After all, we were a family before.

166
00:09:48,539 --> 00:09:50,179
Besides, you're so powerful.

167
00:09:50,419 --> 00:09:54,279
If you sleep with her,
could that cure her?

168
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:55,740
No way.

169
00:09:56,940 --> 00:09:58,279
I will never agree to that.

170
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,580
With my potent vitality,
I certainly could.

171
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:04,740
Without the vows of marriage,

172
00:10:04,879 --> 00:10:06,519
we cannot engage in marital intimacy.

173
00:10:07,019 --> 00:10:08,299
That is my bottom line,

174
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:09,679
and I won't cross it.

175
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:12,559
(Does he expect me to initiate it?)

176
00:10:29,577 --> 00:10:33,168
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

177
00:10:33,168 --> 00:10:35,955
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

178
00:10:36,531 --> 00:10:38,693
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

179
00:10:38,693 --> 00:10:41,539
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

180
00:10:41,539 --> 00:10:44,817
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

181
00:10:44,817 --> 00:10:46,451
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

182
00:10:46,451 --> 00:10:48,515
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

183
00:10:48,515 --> 00:10:50,051
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

184
00:10:50,051 --> 00:10:52,833
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

185
00:10:53,282 --> 00:10:55,187
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

186
00:10:55,187 --> 00:11:01,218
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

187
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:05,683
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

188
00:11:05,683 --> 00:11:08,908
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

189
00:11:09,420 --> 00:11:12,019
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

190
00:11:12,019 --> 00:11:17,147
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

191
00:11:17,147 --> 00:11:20,675
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

192
00:11:20,675 --> 00:11:24,383
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

193
00:11:24,383 --> 00:11:26,275
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

194
00:11:26,275 --> 00:11:28,352
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

195
00:11:28,352 --> 00:11:30,883
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

196
00:11:30,883 --> 00:11:34,920
♪You met the most precious person♪

197
00:11:36,588 --> 00:11:38,451
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

198
00:11:38,451 --> 00:11:40,970
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

199
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:42,419
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

200
00:11:42,419 --> 00:11:44,721
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

201
00:11:44,721 --> 00:11:46,691
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

202
00:11:46,691 --> 00:11:51,101
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

203
00:11:51,101 --> 00:11:52,643
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

204
00:11:52,643 --> 00:11:54,553
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

205
00:11:54,553 --> 00:11:57,827
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

206
00:11:57,827 --> 00:12:01,148
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

207
00:12:01,148 --> 00:12:02,883
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

208
00:12:02,883 --> 00:12:07,507
♪Just catch your breath first♪

209
00:12:07,507 --> 00:12:11,257
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

210
00:12:11,257 --> 00:12:14,635
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

211
00:12:15,009 --> 00:12:16,979
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

212
00:12:16,979 --> 00:12:22,726
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

213
00:12:22,726 --> 00:12:26,242
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

214
00:12:26,242 --> 00:12:27,811
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

215
00:12:27,811 --> 00:12:30,121
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

216
00:12:30,121 --> 00:12:31,859
♪From laughter to devotion♪

217
00:12:31,859 --> 00:12:33,915
♪From falling to innocence♪

218
00:12:33,915 --> 00:12:35,763
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

219
00:12:35,763 --> 00:12:42,433
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
